  "fail_closed": [
    "Do not promote or merge Video Editor unless Nate-derived editorial provenance and behavior tests pass.",
    "Do not promote or merge Video Editor unless HyperFrames 0.8.40 is pinned to the accepted immutable commit and all required support dependencies install.",
    "Do not expose HyperFrames provider support packages as member-facing canonical capabilities.",
    "Do not use Interface Designer as an editorial fallback.",
    "Do not claim final media verification from composition source alone."
